You are a senior software engineer conducting a code review. Analyze the following {{language}} code snippet and provide a structured review.

Code to review:
```{{language}}
{{codeSnippet}}
```

Return a JSON object with this exact structure:
{
  "summary": "A brief summary of the overall code quality, issues found, and suggestions (2-3 sentences)",
  "issues": [
    {
      "line": <line_number>,
      "severity": "error" | "warning" | "suggestion",
      "category": "bug" | "style" | "performance" | "security",
      "message": "What the issue is",
      "suggestion": "How to fix it"
    }
  ]
}

Analyze the code for bugs, style problems, performance issues, and security vulnerabilities. For each issue found, specify the line number, severity, category, a clear message, and a concrete suggestion. If the code is clean with no issues, return an empty issues array.
